        "practicalActivity": "Finish dinner by 8:00 PM, brush your teeth, and sip warm jeera water if thirsty before bed.",
        "measurableHabitTarget": "Fast for at least 11 consecutive hours overnight (e.g., 8:30 PM to 7:30 AM) on 6 nights.",
